Short description
-----------------

contraction.f90

  constraction mesh build from 7 submeshes (2D)

contraction3D.f90

  constraction mesh build from 7 submeshes (3D)

objects_in_mesh.f90

  simple example mesh with objects

mesh_center_refine3D.f90

 3D mesh, with refinement near the middle

mesh_center_refine3D_2.f90

 3D mesh, with refinement near the middle
 similar to mesh_center_refine3D.f90, but now using add_to_mesh with
 matchingsurface to change orientation of the surfaces.

mesh_spectral_quad.f90

 A curved quadrilateral region meshed using spectral elements. 
 Ratio and factor is used to refine the elements towards a boundary.
 mesh_convert is used to make a mesh that can be plotted.

adaptive_mesh_pos.f90

 In this program, a scalar function is used to refine a mesh. The value of 
 the scalar function indicates the mesh element size at that location

ellipsoid_in_a_box.geo

 ellipsoidal object in a box using gmsh. Volume between surface of the object
 and the box is meshed. 

